    html+=start(9)+head(9,t('测试没有挑最顺的那条路。三个任务里，两个都在考出错以后的事，改掉一份有问题的草稿，以及中途离开再回来。AI 产品最容易在这两处丢掉信任。','Testing skipped the smooth path on purpose. Two of the three tasks were about what happens after something goes wrong: fixing a flawed draft, and leaving halfway then coming back. That is where AI products most often lose trust.'))
