    html+=f'<div class="field-photos"><figure>{image("finfold-linkx-presentation",t("Finfold 项目现场演示","Presenting Finfold in person"))}</figure><figure>{image("finfold-linkx-live-demo-redacted",t("Finfold 线下产品交流","Finfold in a live product conversation"))}</figure></div><p class="source-line">{t("项目展示与交流记录","From project presentations and live demos")}</p><div class="outcome-note"><h3>{t("这个项目<br>改掉了我的一个习惯","The habit this project<br>broke for me")}</h3><p>{t("做 AI 产品，很容易被演示牵着走。顺利生成的那条路最好画，也最容易骗过自己。这次我把大部分时间花在演示里看不到的时刻，模型慢了，草稿失败了，用户走开又回来。这些时刻不会出现在台上，用户却要在这里决定，还敢不敢把自己的账号交给它。","AI products are easy to design for the demo. The happy path is the easiest thing to draw and the easiest way to fool yourself. This time I spent most of my hours on the moments a demo never shows: the model is slow, a draft fails, someone leaves and comes back. None of that makes it on stage, but it’s exactly where people decide whether to trust the product with their account.")}</p></div>'+end
